{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 48, :comments ["<b>And he gathered all, etc.</b> According to what we explained in our comment on (Genesis 41:34) ״וְחִמֵּשׁ אֶת״ etc. — that he would take the fifth portion — the meaning of his saying <b>and he gathered all the food</b> would refer to the portion belonging to the king, as stated in Joseph's words. And when we explain ״וְחִמֵּשׁ״ as — 'and he spurred' (i.e., וִיזָרֵז), it is possible to explain his saying <b>and he gathered all</b> according to its plain sense: that he would acquire all the produce that the year produced in excess of the other years, for since it was a surplus for the sowers of the ground, they would sell the remainder."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:47:46.825067524Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}